I rate this Provisionally Awesome.  Provisionally because:
- The maze should never be made unsolvable by the switch (no spaces
should be walled off at any time), which could be quite difficult to
implement.  This is because the player could get stuck in an area
without a means of digging, and be unable to progress until the RNG
decides to let him loose.
- The walls should never cover the Vibrating Square, staircases, or
the big items, for what should be obvious reasons.
- Consideration should be made concerning what is done with dug-out
levels.  (How does it remove a wall when there are none to remove?
What about when new wall sections have no remaining bordering walls?)
- Finally, if this is implemented I'd say it means the Mysterious
Force should kick in less often.

- John H.

